230
00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.740
Hindi ko talaga masabi.

231
00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:28.650
May gusto akong itanong sayo.

232
00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:36.290
Isang bagay na napagdesisyunan kong itatanong ko kung sakaling nakita kita muli.

233
00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:41.630
Noon...

234
00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:43.830
Noong nakipaghiwalay ka sa akin...

235
00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.070
Bakit mo ginawa yun?

236
00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.510
pagkatapos noon,

237
00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:52.640
Pumunta ako sa Vivaldi...

238
00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.480
at nakita ang note na iniwan mo.

239
00:17:57.650 --> 00:17:59.449
Tinakbo ko ito papuntang Cheongah Bus,

240
00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.520
pero wala ka na.

241
00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.120
Kaya, bakit mo ginawa ito?

242
00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:16.170
Well...

243
00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:21.270
Hindi ko talaga maalala.

244
00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:23.370
Napakatagal na noon.

245
00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.280
Alam mo kung gaano ako impulsive.

246
00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.160
Kaya, ano ang tungkol sa iyo?

247
00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.029
Mukhang close kayo ni Yeong Rye.

248
00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:45.230
Yeah, I guess so.

249
00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.130
Siya ay isang kaibigan na hindi ko maisip ang aking buhay na wala.

250
00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.630
Parang Sang Cheol lang.

251
00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:51.770
Kaya...

252
00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:53.970
